          "date": "2026-03-02",
          "time": "11:23",
          "text": "## Summary\n\nThis report records the root‑cause analysis of the client sync failure, confirms the final decision to send a resolution summary, and outlines safeguards to prevent recurrence.",
          "sender": null,
          "authority": {
            "item_id": "event_051__m3_a2_document::p1",
